\subtree{
\title{3.7 The counters}

\p{One worker, file order. First that the change does nothing when it is switched off: the build of the change with \code{\verb~|-X repeats=check~} against the base. Every count of the machine, the reference engine, the driver and the loader is identical on all eight corpora (187 to 192 keys; the three new statistics apart), and so are the ticks and the outcome of every unit. The loader's table changes nothing that an engine sees.}

\p{Then the skip against the base. "Nothing kept between declarations" is the default switch set without what outlives a declaration: \code{\verb~|-X machine.switches=default,-warm,-pchk,-skipargs,-facts~} (no warm session, no check facts, no fact records, and \code{skipargs}, which needs them).}

\table{
